{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02670","headline":"送金竟陵入蜀 · 崔信明","name":"送金竟陵入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金门去蜀道，玉垒望长安。\n岂言千里远，方寻九折难。\n西上君飞葢，东归我挂冠。\n猨声出峡断，月彩落江寒。\n从今与君别，花月几新残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔信明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}